        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Fuyang, Gaozhou, Xincun, Anhui, Funan County, Guangdong Province, Beijing, Huaining\n- People: Deng Jiaxian\n- Topics: Chinese administrative divisions\n\nFacts:\n- Deng Jiaxian was born on June 25, 1924, in Huaining, Anhui province.\n- Fuyang is a prefecture-level city in northwestern Anhui province, China.\n- Gaozhou is a county-level city in southwestern Guangdong Province, China.\n- Xincun is a township-level division in Funan County, Fuyang, Anhui, China.\n- Deng Jiaxian died on July 29, 1986, in Beijing.",
